<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第四幕 · 你写哪类程序</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>对陌生插件，两条路都还没有安全答案</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "stretch", minHeight: 56, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Box style={{width: 200, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 600}}></Text></Box><Box style={{width: 460, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 600}}>路一 · 自己组装</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 460, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 600}}>路二 · DSH</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "stretch", minHeight: 68, background: "transparent", borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Box style={{width: 200, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 400}}>对陌生插件</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 460, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 400}}>自己组装：没有沙箱——装一个陌生包，约等于执行它的任意代码</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 460, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 400}}>DSH：插件化不等于安全——插件拿到的是同样的能力面</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "stretch", minHeight: 68, background: "transparent", borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Box style={{width: 200, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 400}}>所以</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 460, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 400}}>都不是「更先进的选择」，是正在演进的路线</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 460, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 16px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, fontWeight: 400}}>两条路都还在补这一课</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>33 / 36</Text></Box></Box>
